  "description": ".NET bindings for libopus 1.6: an Opus encoder and decoder with every control typed (bitrate, complexity, in-band FEC, DTX, bandwidth, signal), packet inspection, and float, 16-bit and 24-bit PCM, over complete source-generated bindings to libopus. Ships libopus for Windows, Linux and macOS on x64 and arm64. Allocation-free on the encode and decode paths, Native AOT compatible.",
